{"lesson_uid":"L0010","_provenance":{"generator":"backend/scripts/generate_lesson_zhuyin.py","reading_authority":"frontend/src/components/zhuyin/polyphonicProcessor.ts（跑，非移植）","source_font":"frontend/public/fonts/BpmfZihiSerif-Regular.ttf","font_sha256_16":"fc25a90d27699ec4","poyin_db_sha256_16":"882bc0ae69aeef35","notation":"pypinyin BopomofoConverter（與 font_readings.json 同一個轉換器）","stats":{"texts":219,"chars":5135,"poly_positions":1268,"he_adjudicated":0,"xiang_adjudicated":0,"manual_corrections":0}},"texts":[{"section":"full_text_annotate","slug":"ajk7q","idx":1,"text":"我叫阿耀，是您母校棒球隊的學弟，現在八年級，擔任投手兼外野手。最近我有個煩惱一直在腦中揮之不去，想請教您。","n":53,"ssz":"...................................1..2......1......."},{"section":"full_text_annotate","slug":"ajk7q","idx":2,"text":"升上八年級後，我被排進先發名單，除了大隊訓練和晨操，我晚上還會自己加練。雖然很累很操，但我真的喜歡棒球，而且不少學長都告訴我們：「球打得好，以後就有高中、大學可讀；更強的話，高中就能直接進職棒！」我總是夢想有朝一日能像您一樣進職棒。","n":116,"ssz":"......................1..................................1.........1....................................1.....1....."},{"section":"full_text_annotate","slug":"ajk7q","idx":3,"text":"但老師又會勸誡我們：「打球雖然重要，但書還是要讀。」我知道這是為我們好，可是訓練後真的累癱了，一聽到這些話就覺得煩，甚至有點想逃避。我總是在想：一定要讀書嗎？未來真的不能只靠打球嗎？","n":91,"ssz":"...............................1.......................1................1.................."},{"section":"full_text_annotate","slug":"ajk7q","idx":4,"text":"您是我最崇拜的學長，也是真正走過這條路的人，想聽聽您的看法。謝謝您！","n":34,"ssz":"........1......................1.."},{"section":"full_text_annotate","slug":"ajk7q","idx":1,"text":"謝謝你的來信，很開心看到你對棒球這麼熱愛。我當年和你一樣，天天拚命練球，心裡只想著怎麼打得更好。","n":48,"ssz":".1......................1.1.................1..."},{"section":"full_text_annotate","slug":"ajk7q","idx":2,"text":"說實話，我以前也覺得只要球打得好，就能進職棒、獲得豐厚報酬。但等我真的進了職棒，我才發現：成功，不只要努力，還要「運氣站在你這邊」。","n":66,"ssz":".........1....1..................................................."},{"section":"full_text_annotate","slug":"ajk7q","idx":3,"text":"怎麼說呢？就算你再怎麼拚，還是可能遇到以下這些情況：","n":26,"ssz":".........................."},{"section":"full_text_annotate","slug":"ajk7q","idx":4,"text":"同年選秀剛好出現一堆「怪物級」選手，你就算很強，也未必雀屏中選。","n":32,"ssz":"........2....................1.."},{"section":"full_text_annotate","slug":"ajk7q","idx":5,"text":"長時間比賽、過度疲憊，身體很容易受傷，萬一需要休息，就可能和機會擦身而過。","n":37,"ssz":".............................1......."},{"section":"full_text_annotate","slug":"ajk7q","idx":6,"text":"守備的位置有太多人爭取，即使你實力不錯，也可能沒機會上場。","n":29,"ssz":".................1..........."},{"section":"full_text_annotate","slug":"ajk7q","idx":7,"text":"這些都不是你能控制的。所以我想跟你說：「打球很重要，但如果你孤注一擲，只有這一條路可走，真的太冒險了。」","n":52,"ssz":"...1................................................"},{"section":"full_text_annotate","slug":"ajk7q","idx":8,"text":"讀書，不是要你考高分，而是讓你多一條路。當棒球這條路卡住的時候，你還有別的方向可以走。就像比賽不能只練一招，人生也不能只靠一種能力。你準備得越多，選擇就越多喔！祝福你。","n":84,"ssz":"...1...............................................2.........2.......1........1....."},{"section":"key_reading","slug":"wkmdr","idx":null,"text":"說實話，我以前也覺得只要球打得好，就能進職棒、獲得豐厚報酬。但等我真的進了職棒，我才發現：成功，不只要努力，還要「運氣站在你這邊」。怎麼說呢？就算你再怎麼拚，還是可能遇到以下這些情況：同年選秀剛好出現一堆「怪物級」選手，你就算很強，也未必雀屏中選。長時間比賽、過度疲憊，身體很容易受傷，萬一需要休息，就可能和機會擦身而過。守備的位置有太多人爭取，即使你實力不錯，也可能沒機會上場。這些都不是你能控制的。所以我想跟你說：「打球很重要，但如果你孤注一擲，只有這一條路可走，真的太冒險了。」讀書，不是要你考高分，而是讓你多一條路。當棒球這條路卡住的時候，你還有別的方向可以走。就像比賽不能只練一招，人生也不能只靠一種能力。你準備得越多，選擇就越多喔！祝福你。","n":326,"ssz":".........1....1.....................................................................................2....................1...............................1........................1..............1...................................................1...............................................2.........2.......1........1....."},{"section":"served:series","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"一般","n":2,"ssz":".."},{"section":"served:title","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"把球打好，就夠了嗎？──阿耀與健豪學長的通信（一）","n":25,"ssz":"..................1......"},{"section":"served:genre","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"應用文","n":3,"ssz":"1.."},{"section":"served:reading_strategy","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"生涯探索──讀書，讓夢想多一條路","n":16,"ssz":"................"},{"section":"served:reading_strategy_explained","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"這一課我們要練習的是「想想看，未來還有什麼可能」，因為阿耀學弟熱愛棒球，但學長告訴他，人生不能只有一種選擇，讀書可以幫助你多開一條路，這樣當遇到困難時，你才不會只有一條路走，讀的時候，可以試著想想看，如果阿耀學長沒有打棒球，他還能做些什麼呢","n":120,"ssz":".1........................1...........1..........2............................1..........................1.............."},{"section":"served:intro.background","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"這篇文章記錄了一位熱愛棒球的八年級學弟阿耀，寫信給他崇拜的職棒學長，詢問關於棒球與課業的煩惱。阿耀夢想成為職棒選手，但老師卻要他兼顧課業，讓他感到迷惘，不確定是否只能靠打球。學長回信分享了自己在職棒路上的經驗，他點出即使球技再好，也可能受到外在因素影響，例如競爭激烈、傷病或位置問題，因此他認為人生不能只靠單一技能，讀書是為了多開闢一條路，增加更多人生選擇。","n":179,"ssz":".......1........................1...........................................1...........1.................................................................1......1................."},{"section":"served:manifest_sections[0].no","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"一","n":1,"ssz":"."},{"section":"served:manifest_sections[0].name","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"讀全文-做記號","n":7,"ssz":"......."},{"section":"served:manifest_sections[1].no","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"二","n":1,"ssz":"."},{"section":"served:manifest_sections[1].name","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"念順順","n":3,"ssz":"..."},{"section":"served:manifest_sections[2].no","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"三","n":1,"ssz":"."},{"section":"served:manifest_sections[2].name","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"語詞我最棒","n":5,"ssz":"....."},{"section":"served:manifest_sections[3].no","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"四","n":1,"ssz":"."},{"section":"served:manifest_sections[3].name","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"語詞應用","n":4,"ssz":"..1."},{"section":"served:manifest_sections[4].no","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"五","n":1,"ssz":"."},{"section":"served:manifest_sections[4].name","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"文章重點表","n":5,"ssz":"....."},{"section":"served:manifest_sections[5].no","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"六","n":1,"ssz":"."},{"section":"served:manifest_sections[5].name","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"品格聚光燈","n":5,"ssz":"....."},{"section":"served:manifest_sections[6].no","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"七","n":1,"ssz":"."},{"section":"served:manifest_sections[6].name","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"閱讀理解","n":4,"ssz":"...."},{"section":"served:manifest_sections[7].no","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"八","n":1,"ssz":"."},{"section":"served:manifest_sections[7].name","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"詞語複習","n":4,"ssz":"...."},{"section":"served:manifest_sections[8].no","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"九","n":1,"ssz":"."},{"section":"served:manifest_sections[8].name","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"知識補給站","n":5,"ssz":"...1."},{"section":"served:vocabulary[0].word","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"有朝一日","n":4,"ssz":".1.."},{"section":"served:vocabulary[0].definition","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"未來的某一天","n":6,"ssz":"......"},{"section":"served:vocabulary[1].word","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"疲憊","n":2,"ssz":".."},{"section":"served:vocabulary[1].definition","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"身體或精神非常累。","n":9,"ssz":"........."},{"section":"served:vocabulary[2].word","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"孤注一擲","n":4,"ssz":"...."},{"section":"served:vocabulary[2].definition","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"把全部力量或希望放在一次行動上，冒險做最後一搏。","n":24,"ssz":"........................"},{"section":"served:vocabulary[3].word","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"累癱","n":2,"ssz":".."},{"section":"served:vocabulary[3].definition","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"累到像癱瘓了一樣，幾乎動不了。","n":15,"ssz":"......1..1....."},{"section":"served:vocabulary[4].word","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"雀屏中選","n":4,"ssz":"..1."},{"section":"served:vocabulary[4].definition","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"在一群優秀人才中，被選中了。","n":14,"ssz":".............."},{"section":"served:vocabulary[5].word","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"豐厚","n":2,"ssz":".."},{"section":"served:vocabulary[5].definition","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"形容東西很豐富、很充足。常用來形容報酬或獎品。","n":23,"ssz":"......................."},{"section":"served:vocabulary[6].word","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"揮之不去","n":4,"ssz":"..1."},{"section":"served:vocabulary[6].definition","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"一直留在心中或腦中，想忘也忘不了。","n":17,"ssz":"................."},{"section":"served:vocabulary[7].word","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"報酬","n":2,"ssz":".."},{"section":"served:vocabulary[7].definition","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"指完成事情之後得到的回報。","n":13,"ssz":"............."},{"section":"served:vocabulary[8].word","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"勸誡","n":2,"ssz":".."},{"section":"served:vocabulary[8].definition","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"好好的提醒或告訴別人不要做錯事。","n":16,"ssz":"..........1....."},{"section":"served:vocabulary[9].word","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"擦身而過","n":4,"ssz":"...."},{"section":"served:vocabulary[9].definition","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"比喻差一點就得到，最後卻錯過人、事或機會。","n":21,"ssz":"...2..2.............."},{"section":"served:fill_in_blank[0].sentence","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"今天爬山爬了一整天，我一回家就（　）在沙發上。","n":23,"ssz":"......2................"},{"section":"served:fill_in_blank[1].sentence","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"姊姊弄丟了珍貴的項鍊，只要一想起這件事，那種難過的感覺就（　）。","n":32,"ssz":".1...........2.................."},{"section":"served:fill_in_blank[2].sentence","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"這次比賽的獎品非常（　），有玩具、文具，還有禮券！","n":25,"ssz":"........................."},{"section":"served:fill_in_blank[3].sentence","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"公司面臨倒閉危機，老闆（　），拿出全部資金研發新產品。","n":27,"ssz":"....1......................"},{"section":"served:fill_in_blank[4].sentence","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"他做事總是猶豫不決，每次下定決心時，機會早就和他（　）。","n":28,"ssz":"......................1....."},{"section":"served:fill_in_blank[5].sentence","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"經過校隊選拔，小華（　），成為正式隊員。","n":20,"ssz":"...................."},{"section":"served:fill_in_blank[6].sentence","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"姊姊（　）哥哥不要一直玩手機，要注意眼睛健康。","n":23,"ssz":".1....11.2............."},{"section":"served:fill_in_blank[7].sentence","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"走了一整天的路，我已經（　）不堪，只想躺下休息。","n":24,"ssz":"..2....................."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[0].question","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"下列的語詞，何者使用錯誤？","n":13,"ssz":"............."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[0].options[0]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"他憑著流利的英文，從眾多應徵者中「雀屏中選」，得到工作","n":27,"ssz":"...................1......."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[0].options[1]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"他與夢想的大學「擦身而過」，只差一分沒錄取","n":21,"ssz":"................2...."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[0].options[2]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"那次比賽失誤的畫面，一直在他心中「揮之不去」","n":22,"ssz":"..........2........1.."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[0].options[3]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"這部電影富含教育意義，小明「勸誡」我去看那部電影","n":24,"ssz":"........................"},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[1].question","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"信中提到「成功，不只要努力，還要『運氣站在你這邊』」，這句話主要想表達什麼？","n":38,"ssz":"......................................"},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[1].options[0]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"努力很重要，但運氣比努力更重要","n":15,"ssz":"..............."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[1].options[1]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"成功需要努力，也會受到運氣和機會影響","n":18,"ssz":".............1...."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[1].options[2]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"只要實力夠強，就能克服所有外在影響","n":17,"ssz":"................."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[1].options[3]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"遇到運氣不好時，再努力也沒有什麼作用","n":18,"ssz":".................."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[2].question","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"健豪學長列出「遇到怪物級選手」「身體受傷」「沒機會上場」等例子，主要想說明什麼？","n":40,"ssz":"...1..........................1........."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[2].options[0]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"打球時要小心身體健康，避免受傷","n":15,"ssz":"..............."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[2].options[1]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"只有最強的人才能在職棒中生存","n":14,"ssz":".............."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[2].options[2]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"有些不可預測的因素會影響成功機會","n":16,"ssz":"................"},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[2].options[3]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"運氣不好就不要打球，以免白費心力","n":16,"ssz":".....1.........."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[3].question","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"從兩封信的內容推論，阿耀最可能是哪一種學生？","n":22,"ssz":".................2...."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[3].options[0]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"對讀書有些抗拒，但非常熱愛打球","n":15,"ssz":"..............."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[3].options[1]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"認為課業和球技一樣，都值得投入","n":15,"ssz":"....1..1....1.."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[3].options[2]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"對未來沒有想法，只照學長的話做","n":15,"ssz":"...........1..."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[3].options[3]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"想放棄棒球，專心準備學校考試","n":14,"ssz":".............."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[4].question","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"健豪學長在回信中，用了哪一種方法，讓阿耀更明白「讀書能讓人多一條路」？","n":35,"ssz":"...1........2......................"},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[4].options[0]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"他用很多難詞和成語，讓文章更有氣勢","n":17,"ssz":"......1.........."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[4].options[1]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"他舉出不同的例子，說明只靠打球太危險","n":18,"ssz":".......1.........."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[4].options[2]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"他用誇張的說法，讓故事更精采","n":14,"ssz":".............."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[4].options[3]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"他請阿耀自己去體會，不直接告訴他","n":16,"ssz":"................"},{"section":"served:reading_benchmark.levels[0].threshold","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"＜190字","n":5,"ssz":"....."},{"section":"served:reading_benchmark.levels[0].feedback","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"還要多加練習。","n":7,"ssz":"......."},{"section":"served:reading_benchmark.levels[1].threshold","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"191~220字","n":8,"ssz":"........"},{"section":"served:reading_benchmark.levels[1].feedback","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"嗯，還不錯喲！","n":7,"ssz":"...1..."},{"section":"served:reading_benchmark.levels[2].threshold","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"＞221字","n":5,"ssz":"....."},{"section":"served:reading_benchmark.levels[2].feedback","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"哇嗚，超級厲害！","n":8,"ssz":"........"},{"section":"served:key_reading.instruction","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"請用計時器，從指定段落（二☞）開始朗讀，計時1分鐘讀的字數，並記錄在表格中。如果你計時3次後，對自己還不滿意，可以自己多練幾次喔。最後一次，找一位同學，請他來計時、記錄並簽名！","n":88,"ssz":"...............................................................1.......1................"},{"section":"served:key_reading.timing_table.columns[0]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"第1次計時","n":5,"ssz":"....."},{"section":"served:key_reading.timing_table.columns[1]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"第2次計時","n":5,"ssz":"....."},{"section":"served:key_reading.timing_table.columns[2]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"第3次計時","n":5,"ssz":"....."},{"section":"served:key_reading.timing_table.columns[3]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"裁判計時","n":4,"ssz":"...."},{"section":"served:key_reading.timing_table.unit","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"字","n":1,"ssz":"."},{"section":"served:key_reading.start_text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"說實話，我以前也覺得只要球打得好，就能進職棒、獲","n":24,"ssz":".........1....1........."},{"section":"served:text_type","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"單","n":1,"ssz":"."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[0].text","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"「我現在學的這些，真的有用嗎？」讀書不只是為了考高分，也是在累積未來需要的知識和能力。想讓夢想多一條路，可以這樣想：\n①想方向：如果原來的計畫改變，還有哪些方向？\n②找能力：這些方向需要哪些能力？\n③做準備：我現在可以怎麼學？","n":113,"ssz":".....................1........1........1........................................................................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[0].text#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"「我現在學的這些，真的有用嗎？」讀書不只是為了考高分，也是在累積未來需要的知識和能力。想讓夢想多一條路，可以這樣想：","n":58,"ssz":".....................1........1........1.................."},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[0].text#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"①想方向：如果原來的計畫改變，還有哪些方向？","n":22,"ssz":"......................"},{"section":"served:spotlight_v2.blocks[0].text#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"②找能力：這些方向需要哪些能力？","n":16,"ssz":"............